{"id":"8a8e8912ace06427","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-necessitation-rule.md","title":"Necessitation Rule Application","display":"ex-necessitation-rule — Necessitation Rule Application","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-necessitation-rule","aliases":["89-ex-necessitation-rule"],"display":"ex-necessitation-rule — Necessitation Rule Application","depends_on":["[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-necessitation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-necessitation-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-necessitation-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-necessitation-rule — Necessitation Rule Application"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0935403945ab4ea\" href=\"?note=c0935403945ab4ea\" title=\"89-df-necessitation\">89-df-necessitation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nec}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nec}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the\nnecessitation-rule relation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}necessitation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\Box A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Nec}\n\\land\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\\Box A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}necessitation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\Box A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Nec}\n\\land\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\\Box A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子</li>\n<li>necessitation : 必然化规则 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c0935403945ab4ea\" href=\"?note=c0935403945ab4ea\" title=\"89-df-necessitation\">89-df-necessitation</a>)</li>\n<li>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 GL 定理，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 也是 GL 定理</li>\n<li>内层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span> 是前提序列；这与把规则误写成公式二元关系\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,\\Box A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,\\Box A\\rangle\\)</span> 不同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-necessitation","status":"resolved","id":"c0935403945ab4ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-necessitation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-necessitation","status":"resolved","id":"c0935403945ab4ea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"necessitation : 必然化规则 (see [[89-df-necessitation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nec}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}necessitation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\Box A\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Nec}\n\\land\n\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\\Box A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,\\Box A\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1079,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-545","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-ex-necessitation-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["d246470e97fec132","0006800fa1c85177","c0935403945ab4ea"]}